<header>
  <div class="masthead">
    <span data-en="Direct Trade Uganda" data-de="Direct Trade Uganda">Direct Trade Uganda</span>
    <span data-en="Next consolidated container · Kampala → Hamburg · 2027" data-de="Nächster Sammelcontainer · Kampala → Hamburg · 2027">Next consolidated container · Kampala → Hamburg · 2027</span>
  </div>

  <div class="c">
  <p class="eyebrow" data-en="For farmers, families and coffee brands" data-de="Für Farmer, Familien und Kaffeemarken">For farmers, families and coffee brands</p>
  <h1 data-en="Bring your coffee &lt;em&gt;to Europe with us.&lt;/em&gt;" data-de="Bringt euren Kaffee &lt;em&gt;mit uns nach Europa.&lt;/em&gt;">Bring your coffee <em>to Europe with us.</em></h1>
  <p class="lead" data-en="A shared container takes your coffee from Kampala to Hamburg, from 10 bags. We handle export papers, shipping and import. In Hamburg we sell it on to roasters. You keep your coffee until the container is sealed." data-de="Ein Sammelcontainer bringt euren Kaffee von Kampala nach Hamburg, ab 10 Sack. Wir übernehmen Exportpapiere, Fracht und Import. In Hamburg verkaufen wir ihn an Röster weiter. Der Kaffee bleibt eurer, bis der Container plombiert ist.">A shared container takes your coffee from Kampala to Hamburg, from 10 bags. We handle export papers, shipping and import. In Hamburg we sell it on to roasters. You keep your coffee until the container is sealed.</p>
  <a class="send" href="#form" data-en="Tell us about yourselves" data-de="Erzählt uns von euch">Tell us about yourselves</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="c">
  <p class="sec-note" data-en="The offer" data-de="Das Angebot">The offer</p>
  <p class="lead" data-en="Roasters in Europe buy named lots from named farms. A shared container takes your coffee there from 10 bags." data-de="Röstereien in Europa kaufen benannte Lots von benannten Farmen. Ein Sammelcontainer bringt euren Kaffee ab 10 Sack dorthin.">Roasters in Europe buy named lots from named farms. A shared container takes your coffee there from 10 bags.</p>
  <h3 data-en="How it is sold" data-de="So wird verkauft">How it is sold</h3>
  <p class="lead sm" data-en="We offer your sample to roasters in Europe before the container leaves. Your coffee ships only once a roaster has agreed a price, so you know your price before you sign." data-de="Wir bieten euer Muster vor der Abfahrt Röstern in Europa an. Euer Kaffee fährt nur, wenn ein Röster einen Preis zugesagt hat. So kennt ihr euren Preis, bevor ihr unterschreibt.">We offer your sample to roasters in Europe before the container leaves. Your coffee ships only once a roaster has agreed a price, so you know your price before you sign.</p>
  <table class="cmp-tbl">
    <thead><tr><th></th><th data-en="With a roaster we introduce" data-de="Mit einem Röster von uns">With a roaster we introduce</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    <tr><td data-en="Who sells" data-de="Wer verkauft">Who sells</td><td data-en="we do, to a roaster" data-de="wir, an einen Röster">we do, to a roaster</td></tr>
    <tr><td data-en="Price known" data-de="Preis steht fest">Price known</td><td data-en="before you sign" data-de="bevor ihr unterschreibt">before you sign</td></tr>
    <tr><td data-en="You pay up front" data-de="Ihr zahlt vorab">You pay up front</td><td data-en="nothing" data-de="nichts">nothing</td></tr>
    <tr><td data-en="Our share" data-de="Unser Anteil">Our share</td><td data-en="&lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.4&quot;&gt;EUR 0.40&lt;/span&gt; per kg plus 10% of the sale" data-de="&lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.4&quot;&gt;0,40 €&lt;/span&gt; je kg plus 10 % vom Verkauf"><span class="m" data-eur="0.4">EUR 0.40</span> per kg plus 10% of the sale</td></tr>
    <tr><td data-en="Paid" data-de="Zahlung">Paid</td><td data-en="by us, when the coffee leaves the warehouse; the roaster pays first" data-de="durch uns, wenn der Kaffee das Lager verlässt; der Röster zahlt vorher">by us, when the coffee leaves the warehouse; the roaster pays first</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p class="fine" data-en="Amounts are set in EUR. UGX figures are rounded approximations at the mid-market rate of 9 Nov 2026 (EUR 1 = UGX 4,586); the rate changes." data-de="Beträge gelten in EUR. UGX-Werte sind gerundete Näherungen zum Mittelkurs vom 9.11.2026 (1 € = 4.586 UGX); der Kurs ändert sich.">Amounts are set in EUR. UGX figures are rounded approximations at the mid-market rate of 9 Nov 2026 (EUR 1 = UGX 4,586); the rate changes.</p>
</section>

