      <ol class="steps sr-only">
    <li><div><h3 data-en="Tell us about your coffee" data-de="Kaffee anmelden">Tell us about your coffee</h3><p data-en="Use the form below. We reply within two working days." data-de="Formular unten. Antwort binnen zwei Werktagen.">Use the form below. We reply within two working days.</p></div></li>
